Fri Oct 16 14:24:35 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Use static python3-FOO runtime Requires: bare python-FOO
  names are never translated without python_subpackages and left
  the package uninstallable (declined SR 1378861)
- Fix Summary style (capitalized, no trailing dot)

