Sun Sep 13 12:02:47 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Major update to version 3.1.0:
  * requires securesystemslib >= 1.0, drops deprecated legacy
    key arguments and legacy securesystemslib integration
  * upstream removed the in-toto-keygen CLI, use standard
    key formats with --signing-key/--verification-keys
  * new --run-timeout and --inspection-timeout arguments
  * CVE-2023-32076 (boo#1211293): fixed since 2.0.0, still fixed here
- Drop stale BuildRequires (poetry, setuptools, wheel,
  sphinx/recommonmark): hatchling build backend only
- Run upstream test suite in %check, dedupe with %fdupes
- Tighten %files to the in_toto module and dist-info

